    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d135">

                <pb facs="0316" n="182" xml:id="pg182"/>

                <head>No. 135.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Seibert to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 15, 1888</date>.
                        (Received April 12.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 180.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith copies
                    of the notes exchanged between the British minister here and the Chilian
                    minister of foreign relations, relating to Chili’s liability for a portion of
                    the Peruvian foreign debt, and the Grace-Aranibar contract, as published in the
                    Diario Oficial, and also a translation of the same.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">C. M.
                        Seibert.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d135-a1.xml" xpointer="d135-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d135-a2.xml" xpointer="d135-a2"/>
            </div>
